  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SceneEntity is the fundamental base class for all objects within the engine's scene graph, acting as a core data model component. It encapsulates properties like name, transform, and active state, managing the lifecycle of attached EntityBehaviour instances. It integrates JsonSerializable for persistence and uses Transform for spatial representation, providing methods for serialization, cloning, and lifecycle management (initialize, update, destroy)."
  },
